{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DeclaringSystems","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Declaring Systems","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System()","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/MainActorSystem"],"anchor":"Declaring-Systems"},{"title":"System Parameters","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Update","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceReader","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceWriter","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventWriter","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents"],"anchor":"System-Parameters"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SchedulingSystems","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DrivingAWorldFromAnApp","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System()","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A system is a type with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"run"},{"type":"text","text":" method that a schedule calls once per run. The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"macro turns a structure into a system from the parameters of its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"run"},{"type":"text","text":" method. Each parameter’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type says what part of the world the system works on and whether it reads or writes it, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/access","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is always exact, and a schedule can run systems that don’t conflict at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same time."}]},{"text":"Read and Write Components","anchor":"Read-and-Write-Components","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to read components, and iterate it as you would a world’s query","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"results. Take an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Update","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to change them in place. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"update can also read other components with ","type":"text"},{"code":"Over","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and narrow the entities it visits with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Where","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["@System","struct Climb {","    func run(_ climbers: Update<Position>.Over<Velocity>.Where<Without<Frozen>>) {","        climbers { position, row in","            position.y += abs(row.components.dy)","        }","    }","}","","var world = World()","let climber = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: -3))","let statue = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: -3), Frozen())","Schedule { Climb() }.run(on: &world)","","print(world[Position.self, of: climber].y)","\/\/ Prints \"3.0\"","print(world[Position.self, of: statue].y)","\/\/ Prints \"0.0\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Climb"},{"text":" writes ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"text":" and reads ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Velocity"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Frozen"},{"text":". It conflicts with any system that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"writes ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Velocity"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Frozen"},{"text":", or reads or writes ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"text":", and runs at the same time as any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A parameter’s filter is a list of filter types in "},{"code":"Where","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of filter types. Each mirrors the query filter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the same name."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two parameters that name the same component, one of them writing it, are a compile-time error.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A conflict the macro can’t see by name, such as one through a type alias, traps when a schedule","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes the system.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Read and Write Resources and Events","anchor":"Read-and-Write-Resources-and-Events","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" reads a resource and a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceWriter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" changes one. An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventWriter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sends events, and an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" reads the events sent since the system last read them. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"following schedule sends a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Damage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" event for each entity below the ground, then applies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"damage to its target’s health:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["var world = World()","let knight = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: -1), Health(current: 30))","","let frame = Schedule {","    UpdateEvents()","    Combat()","    ApplyDamage().after(Combat.self)","}","frame.run(on: &world)","print(world[Health.self, of: knight].current)","\/\/ Prints \"20\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventWriter","isActive":true},{"text":" declares ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Combat"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader","isActive":true},{"text":" declares ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ApplyDamage"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Spawn and Despawn Entities","anchor":"Spawn-and-Despawn-Entities","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A system that runs alongside others can’t spawn or despawn entities directly, because that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes every component type at once. Take an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead, and queue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the changes. Commands apply at the end of the wave the system runs in, so systems ordered after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it see them:"}]},{"code":["@System","struct RemoveDefeated {","    func run(_ fighters: Query<Health>, _ commands: inout Commands) {","        for (entity, health) in fighters where health.current <= 0 {","            commands.despawn(entity)","        }","    }","}","","var world = World()","let knight = world.spawn(Health(current: 0))","world.spawn(Health(current: 12))","Schedule { RemoveDefeated() }.run(on: &world)","","print(world.contains(knight))","\/\/ Prints \"false\"","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A commands parameter conflicts with nothing, so it doesn’t stop a system from running at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same time as others."}]},{"text":"Take the Whole World","anchor":"Take-the-Whole-World","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"run"},{"type":"text","text":" method that takes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout World"},{"type":"text","text":" makes a system that can change anything. Its access is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", so a schedule runs it alone, after the systems written before it and before those written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after it. Use one for work that touches many types at once, such as loading a level."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To write a system by hand instead of with the macro, conform a type to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", implement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/run(in:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and declare an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/access","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" listing every type the system reads and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writes."}]},{"text":"Run on the Main Actor","anchor":"Run-on-the-Main-Actor","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mark a system type, or its "},{"code":"run","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method, "},{"code":"@MainActor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to make a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/MainActorSystem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schedule runs on the main actor after the other systems of its wave. Use one to carry results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the world to a user interface."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you’ve declared systems, see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SchedulingSystems","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to order them and run them only when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a condition holds."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/declaringsystems"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Write the rules of a simulation as systems, and let their parameters state what they read and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"write.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Declaring Systems","role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"Systems"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/EventReader":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EventReader","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/eventreader","title":"EventReader","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader","abstract":[{"text":"A system parameter that reads the events of one type sent since the system last read them.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventReader","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/RemovedComponents":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemovedComponents"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"RemovedComponents","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/removedcomponents","abstract":[{"text":"A system parameter that lists the entities that lost a component since the system last read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemovedComponents"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Query":{"abstract":[{"text":"A description of the entities to visit and the components to read from each.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Query","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/query","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Query"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/SchedulingSystems":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/schedulingsystems","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Order the systems of a schedule, run them only when a condition holds, and find out how a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schedule runs them."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SchedulingSystems","kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Scheduling Systems"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/Update":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Update"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/update","title":"Update","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Update","abstract":[{"text":"A system parameter that changes a component of every entity that holds it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Update"}]},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/ResourceReader":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResourceReader"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResourceReader"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/resourcereader","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceReader","abstract":[{"text":"A system parameter that reads a resource.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"ResourceReader"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/DrivingAWorldFromAnApp":{"title":"Driving a World from an App","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DrivingAWorldFromAnApp","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/drivingaworldfromanapp","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Hold a world in your app or game engine, feed it each frame’s input, and let the objects outside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it read results and take part in a step."}],"kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Commands":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Commands"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Commands"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/commands","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","abstract":[{"text":"A buffer of changes to a world, recorded now and applied later in the order they were","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recorded.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Commands"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/AnyOf":{"title":"AnyOf","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/anyof","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A group of types an entity matches by matching at least one of them.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/System":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"System"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/system","title":"System","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A rule that reads and changes a world, run once each time its schedule runs."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"System"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/With":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","title":"With","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/with","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"With"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A filter type that passes the entities holding a component of type ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"With"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/EventWriter":{"title":"EventWriter","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EventWriter","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/eventwriter","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventWriter","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A system parameter that sends events of one type.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventWriter"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/MainActorSystem":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MainActorSystem"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/mainactorsystem","title":"MainActorSystem","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/MainActorSystem","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A system that runs on the main actor, for work that touches main-actor state such as a user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interface."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MainActorSystem"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Added":{"abstract":[{"text":"A filter type that passes the entities whose component of type ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" was added since the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"world’s last run.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Added"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/added","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Added"}],"title":"Added"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Allows":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows","title":"Allows","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/allows","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Allows","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A filter type that also passes the entities holding a disabling component of type ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Allows","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"Systems","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems","url":"\/documentation\/systems","abstract":[{"text":"Declare the rules of a simulation as systems, and run them on a world in a schedule.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/System()":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System()","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/system()","role":"symbol","title":"System()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"System"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Makes a type a system whose access comes from the parameters of its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"run"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Without":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Without"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Without"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/without","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","abstract":[{"text":"A filter type that passes the entities holding no component of type ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Without"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/System/run(in:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"run","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/system\/run(in:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/run(in:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Runs the system’s rule once on a world."}],"kind":"symbol","required":true,"type":"topic","title":"run(in:)"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/ResourceWriter":{"title":"ResourceWriter","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResourceWriter","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/resourcewriter","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResourceWriter","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A system parameter that reads and writes a resource.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceWriter"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/System/access":{"title":"access","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/access","defaultImplementations":1,"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/system\/access","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The component, resource and event types the system reads and writes, or "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if it may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change anything."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"access"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Access","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6AccessV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","required":true,"role":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Changed":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Changed"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Changed"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/changed","abstract":[{"text":"A filter type that passes the entities whose component of type ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" was added or changed since","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the world’s last run.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Changed"}}}